{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0146gkwTz97ijjTn577kRtFU","type":"tool_result","content":"// 只有一個小籤（台上接上了、推牌的結果）\nfunction sayN(gain) { $('#sub').innerHTML = gain ? `<div class=\"sub n\"><span class=\"gain\">${esc(gain)}</span></div>` : ''; }\nfunction say(who, tx, gain) {\n  $('#sub').innerHTML = tx ? `<div class=\"sub\">${who ? `<span class=\"who\">${esc(who)}</span><br>` : ''}<span class=\"tx\">${esc(tx)}</span>${gain ? `<span class=\"gain\">${esc(gain)}</span>` : ''}</div>` : '';\n}\n// 帶高亮的字幕：需要、事件的詞會亮起來；gain 可以放情報小籤\nfunction sayH(who, html, gain) {\n  $('#sub').innerHTML = html ? `<div class=\"sub\">${who ? `<span class=\"who\">${esc(who)}</span><br>` : ''}<span class=\"tx\">${html}</span>${gain ? `<span class=\"gain\">${gain}</span>` : ''}</div>` : '';\n}\nconst fc = f => `<i class=\"fc\" style=\"background:${FCOL[f]};${f === 'fight' ? 'color:#1c1719' : ''}\">${FAM[f].n}</i>`;\nfunction refresh() {\n  const on = view !== 'title';\n  $('#hud').hidden = !on; $('#title').hidden = on;\n  if (!on) { renderTitle(); $('#coach').hidden = true; hidePeek(); return; }\n  // 規矩、後台、水牌攤開時，字幕先收起來，紙用整個中間\n  document.querySelector('.talk').hidden = !!panel;\n  $('#hud').dataset.v = view;\n  const mb = $('#musicBtn'); mb.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(musicOn)); mb.textContent = musicOn ? '乐 开' : '乐 关'; mb.title = musicOn ? '背景音乐：开着（点一下关）' : '背景音乐：关着（点一下开）';\n  renderPlate(); renderBoardChip(); renderTop(); renderLeft(); renderMid(); renderChoices(); renderHand(); fitSpread(); peekSync(); renderSmear();\n  updateTable();\n  coachUpdate();\n  save();\n}\nfunction renderTitle() {\n  $('#title').innerHTML = `<div class=\"title-in\">\n    <div class=\"vb\"><div class=\"t\">底色</div><div class=\"s\">戏城 · 三幕</div></div>\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"intro\">你坐在戏班的桌前。十天，三幕。白天把牌排上戏台，傍晚把它翻过来，推给对面的阿檀。</p>\n      <p class=\"lede\">每打一张，脸上多一层油彩。没卸掉的油彩，会染上你推给她的牌，灯上就留一道痕。她每晚有一个需要，推不够，灯就熄一截。听台下的闲话、听她说往后几天的事，照着装匣。去后台买东西，花的就是卖座，名次会掉。灯熄满五回，她就走了；幕末考核垫底，牌子就被摘了——两样都会让这一季提前结束。</p>\n      <div class=\"form\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"nm\">你的小名</label><input id=\"nm\" maxlength=\"6\" value=\"${esc(draftName)}\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n        <label class=\"tg\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"tutChk\" ${tutPref() ? 'checked' : ''}>带教学小框</label>\n        <button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"start\">开锣</button>\n        ${saved ? `<button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"cont\">接着玩 · 第 ${saved.day} 天</button>` : ''}\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hint\">${glOK ? '建议戴耳机、在大屏幕上玩。' : '这台设备显示不了 3D，卡牌和剧情照样能玩。'}约 55 分钟。所有数字都是占位，待试玩校准。</p>\n    </div></div>`;\n}\n// ── 詞條：教學、規矩裡的這些詞帶虛線，滑鼠停上去（手機點一下）就有說明 ──","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a86d5cc-dadd-48d8-88f6-40a0a537648f","uuid":"4a139a51-1a09-440d-853f-d44571361c21","timestamp":"2026-11-12T13:32:54.810Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"// 只有一個小籤（台上接上了、推牌的結果）\nfunction sayN(gain) { $('#sub').innerHTML = gain ? `<div class=\"sub n\"><span class=\"gain\">${esc(gain)}</span></div>` : ''; }\nfunction say(who, tx, gain) {\n  $('#sub').innerHTML = tx ? `<div class=\"sub\">${who ? `<span class=\"who\">${esc(who)}</span><br>` : ''}<span class=\"tx\">${esc(tx)}</span>${gain ? `<span class=\"gain\">${esc(gain)}</span>` : ''}</div>` : '';\n}\n// 帶高亮的字幕：需要、事件的詞會亮起來；gain 可以放情報小籤\nfunction sayH(who, html, gain) {\n  $('#sub').innerHTML = html ? `<div class=\"sub\">${who ? `<span class=\"who\">${esc(who)}</span><br>` : ''}<span class=\"tx\">${html}</span>${gain ? `<span class=\"gain\">${gain}</span>` : ''}</div>` : '';\n}\nconst fc = f => `<i class=\"fc\" style=\"background:${FCOL[f]};${f === 'fight' ? 'color:#1c1719' : ''}\">${FAM[f].n}</i>`;\nfunction refresh() {\n  const on = view !== 'title';\n  $('#hud').hidden = !on; $('#title').hidden = on;\n  if (!on) { renderTitle(); $('#coach').hidden = true; hidePeek(); return; }\n  // 規矩、後台、水牌攤開時，字幕先收起來，紙用整個中間\n  document.querySelector('.talk').hidden = !!panel;\n  $('#hud').dataset.v = view;\n  const mb = $('#musicBtn'); mb.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(musicOn)); mb.textContent = musicOn ? '乐 开' : '乐 关'; mb.title = musicOn ? '背景音乐：开着（点一下关）' : '背景音乐：关着（点一下开）';\n  renderPlate(); renderBoardChip(); renderTop(); renderLeft(); renderMid(); renderChoices(); renderHand(); fitSpread(); peekSync(); renderSmear();\n  updateTable();\n  coachUpdate();\n  save();\n}\nfunction renderTitle() {\n  $('#title').innerHTML = `<div class=\"title-in\">\n    <div class=\"vb\"><div class=\"t\">底色</div><div class=\"s\">戏城 · 三幕</div></div>\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"intro\">你坐在戏班的桌前。十天，三幕。白天把牌排上戏台，傍晚把它翻过来，推给对面的阿檀。</p>\n      <p class=\"lede\">每打一张，脸上多一层油彩。没卸掉的油彩，会染上你推给她的牌，灯上就留一道痕。她每晚有一个需要，推不够，灯就熄一截。听台下的闲话、听她说往后几天的事，照着装匣。去后台买东西，花的就是卖座，名次会掉。灯熄满五回，她就走了；幕末考核垫底，牌子就被摘了——两样都会让这一季提前结束。</p>\n      <div class=\"form\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"nm\">你的小名</label><input id=\"nm\" maxlength=\"6\" value=\"${esc(draftName)}\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n        <label class=\"tg\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"tutChk\" ${tutPref() ? 'checked' : ''}>带教学小框</label>\n        <button class=\"btn go\" data-act=\"start\">开锣</button>\n        ${saved ? `<button class=\"btn\" data-act=\"cont\">接着玩 · 第 ${saved.day} 天</button>` : ''}\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hint\">${glOK ? '建议戴耳机、在大屏幕上玩。' : '这台设备显示不了 3D，卡牌和剧情照样能玩。'}约 55 分钟。所有数字都是占位，待试玩校准。</p>\n    </div></div>`;\n}\n// ── 詞條：教學、規矩裡的這些詞帶虛線，滑鼠停上去（手機點一下）就有說明 ──","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0146gkwTz97ijjTn577kRtFU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
